---
import star from "../assets/svg/star.svg?url";
import folder from "../assets/svg/folder.svg?url";
import branches from "../assets/svg/branches.svg?url";
import mouse from "../assets/svg/mouse.svg?url";
const { language = "en" } = Astro.props;
const spanish = language === "es";
---

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="container services-wrap">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span class="label-star" style={`-webkit-mask-image: url(${star}); mask-image: url(${star});`}></span>
      {spanish ? "[ 01 ] Servicios" : "[ 01 ] What I do"}
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{spanish ? <>En qué te puedo <em>ayudar.</em></> : <>Three things I do <em>better</em> than most.</>}</h2>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-num">01 / {spanish ? "SERVICIO" : "SERVICE"}</div>
        <div class="service-icon"><img src={folder} alt=""></div>
        <h3 class="service-title">{spanish ? "Desarrollo de APIs" : "Backend APIs that scale"}</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          {spanish
            ? "APIs REST y GraphQL con NestJS y Node.js. Defino el acceso a los datos de cada equipo, cubro los flujos con pruebas y dejo trazas para diagnosticar errores."
            : "Production-grade REST and GraphQL APIs with NestJS and Node.js. Multi-tenant, well-tested, observable. The kind of code your team can build on for years."}
        </p>
        <div class="service-tags">
          <span class="service-tag">NestJS</span>
          <span class="service-tag">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="service-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="service-tag">GraphQL</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-num">02 / {spanish ? "SERVICIO" : "SERVICE"}</div>
        <div class="service-icon"><img src={branches} alt=""></div>
        <h3 class="service-title">{spanish ? "Integraciones y facturación" : "Event-driven architecture"}</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          {spanish
            ? "Integro pagos y servicios de terceros. Preparo reintentos seguros para que un error de red no duplique un pedido o un cobro."
            : 'Async workflows, the Outbox Pattern, idempotency, retries that actually retry. For when "send and pray" stops being good enough for your business.'}
        </p>
        <div class="service-tags">
          <span class="service-tag">Outbox Pattern</span>
          <span class="service-tag">Redis</span>
          <span class="service-tag">Idempotency</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <div class="service-num">03 / {spanish ? "SERVICIO" : "SERVICE"}</div>
        <div class="service-icon"><img src={mouse} alt=""></div>
        <h3 class="service-title">{spanish ? "Diagnóstico en producción" : "Production firefighting"}</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          {spanish
            ? "Investigo consultas lentas, registros duplicados y tareas que fallan en silencio. Documento la causa y añado trazas para detectar el problema si reaparece."
            : "Race conditions, duplicate records, jobs failing silently, slow queries. I diagnose the bugs nobody on your team has time to fix — and add the observability to catch the next one."}
        </p>
        <div class="service-tags">
          <span class="service-tag">OpenTelemetry</span>
          <span class="service-tag">Postgres tuning</span>
          <span class="service-tag">Distributed tracing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {!spanish && <p class="services-spanish">
      <a href="/programador-backend" hreflang="es" lang="es">Servicios de programación backend en español →</a>
    </p>}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-spanish { margin-top: 24px; }
  .services-spanish a { color: var(--accent-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  .label-star {
    width: 14px;
    height: 18px;
    background-color: var(--accent);
    -webkit-mask-position: center;
    -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    -webkit-mask-size: contain;
    mask-position: center;
    mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    mask-size: contain;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
